="s140">«</span><span class="s140">тирозинопатии</span><span class="s140">»</span></p></div></td><td class="s138"><div class="s134"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">переаминирования</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s141"><div class="s136"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">алкаптонурии</span></p></div></td><td class="s141"><div class="s134"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">декарбоксилирования</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s138"><div class="s136"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">лейциноз</span></p></div></td><td class="s138"><div class="s134"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">амидирования</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s141"><div class="s136"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">гомоцистинурия</span></p></div></td><td class="s141"><div class="s134"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">переметилирования</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s138"><div class="s136"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">другие</span></p></div></td><td class="s138"><div class="s134"><p class="s135"><span class="s140">пересульфатирования</span></p></div></td></tr></table></div><style type="text/css">
