B1B860.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:686; width:42; height:88;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://ABCD568E-94A4-43E1-9C02-C8297F3D37FB/x-apple-ql-magic/AF2C1C73-3D94-4C19-8E6F-588CE4493053.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-19; left:682; width:44; height:86;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B38F842C-C6A1-4B9E-99D9-E30D404BC165/x-apple-ql-magic/3C0DA2AE-AAFA-4C84-A076-2020301AE11F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-19; left:678; width:40; height:86;"><div style="position:absolute; top:26; left:42; width:648; height:84;"><div class="s69"><div class="s1"><p class="s19"><span class="s144">Некоторые наследственные заболевания, связанные с нарушениями обмена аминокислот</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://FCB79DBE-D95D-4A81-8463-20D8EF582B0B/x-apple-ql-magic/53CCCABB-DC7C-4AEC-93D9-EB69D750E479.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:187; left:152; width:120; height:176;"><table class="s156"><col style="width:178px;"><col style="width:175px;"><col style="width:164px;"><col style="width:201px;"><tr><td class="s147"><div class="s145"><p class="s3"><span class="s146">Заболевание</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s148"><p class="s3"><span class="s146">Нарушенный процесс</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s149"><p class="s3"><span class="s146">Дефект фермента</span></p></div></td><td class="s147"><div class="s150"><p class="s3"><span class="s146">Симптомы</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s152"><div class="s145"><p class="s135"><span class="s151">Альбинизм</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s148"><p class="s3"><span class="s151">синтез меланина</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s149"><p class="s153"><span class="s151">тирозиназа</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s150"><p class="s3"><span class="s151">отсутствие меланина</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s155"><div class="s145"><p class="s154"><span class="s151">Алкаптонурия</span></p></div></td><td class="s155"><div class="s148"><p class="s3"><span class="s151">деградация тирозина</span></p></div></td><td class="s155"><div class="s149"><p class="s153"><span class="s151">гомогентизат-диоксигеназа</span></p></div></td><td class="s155"><div class="s150"><p class="s3"><span class="s151">темная моча, </span></p><p class="s3"><span class="s151">поздние артриты</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class="s152"><div class="s145"><p class="s135"><span class="s151">Фенилкетон</span><span class="s151">-</span></p><p class="s154"><span class="s151">урия</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s148"><p class="s3"><span class="s151">превращение </span><span class="s151">фенилаланин</span><span class="s151"> в тирозин</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s149"><p class="s153"><span class="s151">фенилаланин-гидроксилаза</span></p></div></td><td class="s152"><div class="s150"><p class="s3"><span class="s151">умственная отсталость</span></p><p class="s153"> </p></div></td></tr></table></div><style type="text/css">
