B1B860.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-20; left:686; width:42; height:88;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://ABCD568E-94A4-43E1-9C02-C8297F3D37FB/x-apple-ql-magic/AF2C1C73-3D94-4C19-8E6F-588CE4493053.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-19; left:682; width:44; height:86;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B38F842C-C6A1-4B9E-99D9-E30D404BC165/x-apple-ql-magic/3C0DA2AE-AAFA-4C84-A076-2020301AE11F.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-19; left:678; width:40; height:86;"><div style="position:absolute; top:71; left:42; width:648; height:84;"><div class="s69"><div class="s1"><p class="s19"><span class="s63">Типовые формы нарушений </span><span class="s302"><br></span><span class="s63">углеводного обмена</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:177; left:36; width:648; height:340;"><div class="s11"><p class="s21"><span class="s22">•</span><span class="s23">Гипогликемии</span></p><p class="s75"><span class="s22">•</span><span class="s23">Гипергликемии</span></p><p class="s75"><span class="s22">•</span><span class="s23">Гликогенозы</span><span class="s23"> (</span><span class="s23">агликогенозы</span><span class="s23">)</span></p><p class="s104"> </p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
